          "UNRESOLVED (site): alignment = the existing I-535 line from OpenStreetMap, not a survey or the project\u0027s design line; the replacement\u0027s own alignment is not public.",
          "UNRESOLVED (site): profile = concept (VPIs solved for the charted clearances, deck 20 ft above the ground at the south abutment, -4.0 % toward Duluth, curve lengths 400 / 900 ft); the approach tie-ins (Hammond Ave, Garfield Ave) are not designed.",
          "UNRESOLVED (navigation): clearance reference = NOAA ENC charted VERCLR above Lake Superior Low Water Datum 601.1 ft (IGLD 85); the IGLD 85 - NAVD88 difference at Duluth is not applied (3DEP water 601.96 NAVD88). USCG bridge permit values not checked.",
