          "UNRESOLVED (towers): hollow concrete tuning fork legs 14 x 20 -\u003E 10 x 16 ft, 2 ft walls, concrete strut 12 x 10 ft below the deck, anchorage trays 3\u0027-6 x 5\u0027-6 at 6 ft levels (New NY Fig. 8 arrangement, no dimensions published) - concept values; tray studs, spacer plates, wall / end plate openings and the tower reinforcing are not modeled.",
